---
// News Agency Homepage
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Digital News Agency</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; line-height: 1.6;">
    <header style="border-bottom: 2px solid #333; padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 2.5rem;">THE DAILY CHRONICLE</h1>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0; color: #666;">Your Trusted Digital News Source</p>
    </header>
    
    <main>
      <section style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 25px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <span style="background: #d9534f; color: white; padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px;">BREAKING NEWS</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 10px;"><a href="#" style="color: #111; text-decoration: none;">Your News Site is Successfully Live on Cloudflare!</a></h2>
        <p style="color: #441;">This is your hero story placeholder. Soon, you'll be able to publish stories automatically using your admin dashboard.</p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer style="border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; text-align: center; color: #777; font-size: 0.9rem;">
      <p>&copy; 2026 Digital News Agency. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
